# Git Workflow

- Default GitHub Flow: `main` always deployable; short-lived `feature|fix|chore|docs|hotfix/*` via PR.
- Conventional Commits 1.0: `feat`/`fix` required; `docs|style|refactor|perf|test|build|ci|chore|revert`; breaking via `!` or `BREAKING CHANGE:`.
- Commit language per `project-context` (default English).
- No force-push to shared branches; no secrets/binaries/build dirs in commits.

Korean rationale: `docs/pvc-guide/ko/devops/git-workflow.md`
